            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "You can mark a word or phrase as bold by enclosing it in a single pair of asterisks (e.g., "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "*word*"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": ") (constrained). You can mark bounded characters (i.e., characters within a word) as bold by enclosing them in a pair of double asterisks (e.g., "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "char**act**ers"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": ") (unconstrained)."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
